OL,3,GNEWSAThe world champions charged up for
OL,4,Atitle defence
OL,5,
OL,6,FSilverware, champagne and celebrations
OL,7,Ffilled 2026 for the Formula E world
OL,8,Fchampions Jaguar TCS team as it
OL,9,Fprepares to put its title on the line
OL,10,Fwhen the new season begins next month.
OL,12,FThe lights go out on the new
OL,13,Fall-electric racing car series in Saudi
OL,14,FArabia on 18 December and with it comes
OL,15,Fa new generation of the biggest,
OL,16,Ffastest cars the sport has ever seen.
OL,18,FLast season the Kidlington-based team
OL,19,Fsaw off its nearest challengers Porsche
OL,20,Fby 17 points for its second teams'
OL,21,Fworld championship win.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
